          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for sound bath experiences, VIP days, and private sessions. Sensory, premium gatherings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg-1:#0f1723; /* deep marine */\\n      --bg-2:#081021; /* darker */\\n      --accent:#ff8fb1; /* playful coral */\\n      --accent-2:#7be2e2; /* aqua */\\n      --muted:#98a0b3;\\n      --panel:#0b1220;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:18px;\\n      --max-w:1100px;\\n      --vip-color:#ffd380;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n\\n    html,body{height:100%;}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;\\n      min-height:100%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(123,226,226,0.06), transparent 8%),\\n                  radial-gradient(1000px 500px at 90% 90%, rgba(255,143,177,0.06), transparent 8%),\\n                  linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg-1),var(--bg-2));\\n      color:#e6eef7;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\\n      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n      padding:36px 24px;\\n      box-sizing:border-box;\\n    }\\n\\n    /* Decorative SVG behind content */\\n    .svg-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;opacity:0.9}\\n    .wrap{position:relative;z-index:5;max-width:var(--max-w);margin:0 auto;}\\n\\n    header{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:22px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .brand .logo{\\n      width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#07202a;font-size:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(7,32,42,0.36);\\n    }\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,143,177,0.12),rgba(123,226,226,0.06));color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}\\n\\n    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}\\n\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:24px;align-items:start;padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.05}\\n    .hero p.lead{margin:10px 0 16px;color:var(--muted);max-width:54ch}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .btn{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}\\n    .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#041018}\\n    .btn-outline{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    /* diagnostic */\\n    .panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .diagnostic .q{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px}\\n    .pill{padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--glass);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* plan */\\n    .plan-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .plan-step{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.015),transparent);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    .plan-step h4{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n\\n    /* micro habits */\\n    .micro{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .micro .tip{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));padding:10px;border-radius:12px;min-width:180px}\\n\\n    /* pricing */\\n    .pricing{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}\\n    .card{flex:1;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .price{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:var(--vip-color)}\\n\\n    /* cta / contact form */\\n    form.contact{display:grid;gap:10px}\\n    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:inherit}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    footer{margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}\\n      .plan-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .pricing{flex-direction:column}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <!-- Inline unique SVG pattern for background visual richness (no external assets) -->\\n  <svg class=\\\"svg-backdrop\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1200 800\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <defs>\\n      <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n        <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff8fb1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n        <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#7be2e2\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.06\\\" />\\n      </linearGradient>\\n      <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n        <rect width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"transparent\\\" />\\n        <circle cx=\\\"18\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.03\\\" />\\n        <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"60\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"3\\\" fill=\\\"#ffffff\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.02\\\" />\\n      </pattern>\\n      <filter id=\\\"blur1\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"40\\\"/></filter>\\n    </defs>\\n    <rect width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"800\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n    <g filter=\\\"url(#blur1)\\\">\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"180\\\" cy=\\\"160\\\" rx=\\\"280\\\" ry=\\\"120\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" />\\n      <ellipse cx=\\\"1000\\\" cy=\\\"640\\\" rx=\\\"380\\\" ry=\\\"140\\\" fill=\\\"#0b1220\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.6\\\" />\\n    </g>\\n  </svg>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"/index.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/events.html\\\">Soon</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Investment</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <!-- HERO -->\\n      <section class=\\\"hero panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"hero-heading\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <h1 id=\\\"hero-heading\\\">Connect for a tailored sound experience in {{CITY}}</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We sculpt sensory journeys—sound baths, private sessions, and curated VIP days. Practical guidance, premium materials, and calm-forward design to support deep rest and measurable reset.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"cta-row\\\">\\n            <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n            <a href=\\\"#contact-form\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\">Send a quick note</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:16px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Venue: {{VENUE_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Next: {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside class=\\\"panel\\\" aria-label=\\\"Contact summary\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Quick contact</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Call or text: <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"small\\\">Email: <strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Prefer to plan a private VIP day? We'll draft a one-page proposal after a short consultation.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- DIAGNOSTIC -->\\n      <section class=\\\"panel diagnostic\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"diag-heading\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"diag-heading\\\">Pre-session quick diagnostic</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">This short checklist helps us match the right instruments and flow to your needs. Use it when you reach out.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">1</div><div><strong>Goal</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Relaxation / Focus / Sleep / Creativity</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">2</div><div><strong>Setting</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Intimate studio / Corporate space / Outdoor</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">3</div><div><strong>Accessibility notes</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Mobility, sensory sensitivity, pregnancy, implants</div></div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"q\\\"><div class=\\\"pill\\\">4</div><div><strong>Preferred sound palette</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Gong warmth, harmonic bowls, subtle tuning forks</div></div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- PLAN -->\\n      <section class=\\\"panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"plan-heading\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"plan-heading\\\">How a booking unfolds — a straightforward plan</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We offer clear stages so you know what to expect. The VIP Day model compresses planning and production into a single premium experience.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"plan-grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-step\\\">\\n            <h4>Intro & Intake</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">30–45 min call to define objectives, contraindications, and logistics. We ask about energy levels, hearing sensitivity, and mobility.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-step\\\">\\n            <h4>Space & Setting</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">We tailor layout, lighting, mats, and acoustics. For VIP Day, we can coordinate venue styling and catering add-ons.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-step\\\">\\n            <h4>Session Flow</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Welcome + grounding, 45–75 min immersive sound bath, gentle re-entry and journaling. Optional breath work and voice-led transitions.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"plan-step\\\">\\n            <h4>Follow-up</h4>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email with aftercare micro-habits and a short recording if requested.</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- MICRO_HABITS -->\\n      <section class=\\\"panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"micro-heading\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"micro-heading\\\">Micro-habits: small practices that extend the experience</h3>\\n        <div class=\\\"micro\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"tip\\\"><strong>Hydration ritual</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Drink a full glass of room-temp water before the session.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tip\\\"><strong>Grounding pause</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Three slow inhales/exhales seated before sleeping.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tip\\\"><strong>Sound bookmark</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">Hum a long tone for 30s to reconnect with your session state.</div></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"tip\\\"><strong>Post-session walk</strong><div class=\\\"muted\\\">10-minute stroll outdoors to integrate shifts in the nervous system.</div></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- PRICING -->\\n      <section class=\\\"pricing\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-heading\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card panel\\\">\\n          <h3 id=\\\"pricing-heading\\\">Investment</h3>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Transparent options with custom add-ons for VIP planning.</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"price\\\">VIP Day — inquiry</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Full-day immersive planning + private session. Proposal by request.</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card panel\\\">\\n          <h4>Private Sessions</h4>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">1:1, couples, and corporate sound baths available.</div>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin:12px 0 0 18px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>1:1 (60–90 min) — tailored tone map</li>\\n            <li>Couples — shared memory + boundary-safe sound</li>\\n            <li>Corporate — short reset sessions for teams</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Request pricing</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- CTA / CONTACT FORM -->\\n      <section class=\\\"panel\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"contact-heading\\\">\\n        <h3 id=\\\"contact-heading\\\">Get in touch</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Tell us a little about your needs and we'll reply within 48 hours. If urgent, call {{PHONE}}.</p>\\n\\n        <form id=\\\"contact-form\\\" class=\\\"contact\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" enctype=\\\"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"Full name\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@example.com\\\" required />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone (optional)</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\" />\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"type\\\">Request type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n            <option>Group event / Sound bath</option>\\n            <option>Private session (1:1)</option>\\n            <option>Couples</option>\\n            <option>Corporate / Team</option>\\n            <option>VIP Day planning</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">A short note (goals, date ideas, accessibility)</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"We are looking for...\\\" required></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\">Send message</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" class=\\\"btn btn-outline\\\">Email directly</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\" class=\\\"small\\\">What to bring: yoga mat or blanket, light layers, water, and an intent. Remove noisy jewelry. For VIP Day we provide premium mats and a curated amenity kit on request.</div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"small\\\"><strong>Contraindications & safety:</strong> If you are pregnant, have implanted devices, epilepsy, severe cardiovascular conditions, or active trauma-related triggers, please consult your physician and notify us in the intake call. Sound experiences use harmonic overtones, gongs, tuning forks, and sustained bowls — we adapt volume and frequencies as needed.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      © <span style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</span> • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href=\\\"/about.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\\\">About</a>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"# sound_bath-2026-02-16T11-42-30-547Z-007\\n\\nThis chunk contains two files for the Contact page of the \\\"sound_bath\\\" project.\\n\\nFiles included:\\n- contact.html — the contact & booking page with hero, diagnostic, plan, micro_habits, pricing, and cta sections (all required section pack).\\n- README.md — this file.\\n\\nDesign notes & customization:\\n- Visuals are produced with pure CSS gradients and an inline SVG pattern (no external assets or fonts). The SVG is embedded in contact.html to ensure a rich background without additional files.\\n- The layout follows the \\\"bold_playful\\\" aesthetic with high-contrast gradients, rounded panels, and strong CTAs; copy voice is a practical guide with sensory + premium cues.\\n- Placeholders present in the markup: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}, {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, {{VENUE_NAME}}, {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}. Replace these server-side or with your templating engine.\\n\\nContact form:\\n- The form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Replace with your form endpoint or serverless function URL. Alternatively, use a mailto: link or integrate with your preferred backend.\\n- For VIP Day inquiries, use the provided CTA and indicate in the intake that you want a full-day bespoke proposal.\\n\\nAccessibility & safety copy:\\n- The page includes a short contraindications disclaimer and notes on \\\"what to bring\\\" and session flow (welcome, immersive sound, re-entry, follow-up). Keep these up-to-date for legal and safety compliance.\\n\\nStyle guide:\\n- Color variables are at the top of the inline stylesheet for easy adjustment.\\n- The page avoids external dependencies; you can extract the CSS to a shared stylesheet if combining with other pages.\\n\\nImplementation tips:\\n- Ensure server-side sanitization of form inputs if you implement a direct POST endpoint.\\n- If you need the separate assets/img/pattern.svg for global reuse, extract the <svg> element from contact.html and save it to that path; update CSS to use it via background-image or <img>.\\n\\nVoice & copy variations:\\n- This contact page uses a helpful, practical tone and varies nav labels (Gatherings, Soon, Private, Investment, Learn, Connect) to maintain distinction from other templates.\\n\\nIf you need additional pages (index, events, private-sessions, pricing, about, faq, book) or a separate SVG asset file, I can generate those in subsequent chunks.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
